    <Requirement id="ER-P014-01-01" level="1" requirementType="control">
      <sysml:Name>冷却水系统报警联锁逻辑协调</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水系统应设置高温三级保护逻辑：高温报警、自动减速、自动停机，减速触发点应比报警点高3–5°C。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P014" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-LDR-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>保护逻辑不完善可能导致主机过热损坏。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>审查逻辑图确认高温三级保护设置。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试时模拟高温信号，验证报警、减速、停机动作顺序及触发点差值符合3–5°C。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【冷却水系统报警联锁逻辑协调】，来自原始需求「报警、联锁和保护逻辑应与主机控制系统、机舱监测报警系统协调一致」。E-SUPP-LDR-001原文明确给出高温三级保护及减速触发点比报警点高3–5°C。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
